sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Human as 允许的用户
  participant Source as GitHub Source
  participant Engine as Engine / Store
  participant Main as 主 Session
  participant Worker as Worker / DSH
  participant Out as Outbox / Channel
  Human->>Source: 在 Issue 中提出明确请求
  Source->>Engine: receive(Trigger)
  Note over Engine: 去重、检查范围、保存并排入评估
  Engine-->>Main: 持久递交候选及上下文
  Main->>Engine: decide(accept, scope)
  Note over Engine: 事务创建 Ticket、Mandate、Assignment、订阅
  Engine-->>Worker: 提交后启动或恢复执行
  Worker->>Engine: 报告进度 / 提问 / ready
  Engine-->>Out: 持久记录符合资格的回复
  Out-->>Human: 在原始讨论中确认、提问或交付
  opt 相关 PR 的后续反馈
    Source->>Engine: 评论、审查、CI 或关闭事件
    Engine-->>Worker: 订阅 Input 或领域状态更新
    Note over Worker: 跟进不能扩大原 Mandate
    Worker->>Engine: 报告结果
  end
  Note over Human,Out: ready、PR 创建与最终合并是不同事实
